<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FAFCFE', padding: 0, position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 36, width: '1152px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0E9B78', borderRadius: 5, padding: '3px 11px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>第 30 节</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16232E' }}>核心知识点</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6B7A', marginTop: 10 }}>· 交互程序的骨架与收尾</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: '1280px', height: '720px' }}>
        <svg width='1280' height='720' viewBox='0 0 1280 720'>
            <rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.5 while ... else：</text><text x='82' y='153' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>循环"没被打断"时执行</text><text x='82' y='192.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· else 块只在循环正常走完（没有被 break</text><text x='82' y='211.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>打断）时执行。</text><text x='82' y='240.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· "如果这节课没被老师叫停，就说明大家表现好，</text><text x='82' y='259.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>下课"。</text><text x='82' y='288.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 这段代码读起来非常自然：猜对了就 break 走人，</text><text x='82' y='307.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>猜满 3 次还没对就落进 else。</text><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='468' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='486' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.6 交互程序的骨架</text><text x='486' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· while True 本身没有出口，唯一的出口是 break。</text><text x='486' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 所以每一条通向"用户想退出"的路径，都必须有</text><text x='486' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>break。</text><text x='486' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· 这也是为什么必须有"退出"这个选项——否则用户被永</text><text x='486' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>远困在里面。</text><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='872' y='96' width='368' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='890' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.7 用 while 处理列表和字典（教材 7.3）</text><text x='890' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ① 在列表之间搬元素。</text><text x='890' y='197.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ② 删除所有等于某值的元素。</text><text x='890' y='226.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· ③ 用用户输入来填充字典。</text><text x='64' y='470' fontSize='14.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#0E9B78' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>本节的代码示例</text><text x='64' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· input 的类型陷阱与三步模板</text><text x='468' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· while 基本循环</text><text x='872' y='500' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· break 与 continue</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
            <text x='64' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>Python 讲授课件 · 逐节版</text>
            <text x='1216' y='684' fontSize='13' fill='#8A9AAA' textAnchor='end' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>单元 6 · 第 30 节</text>
        </svg>
    </Box>
</Slide>
